## Evidence needed to revisit the HOLD

A later observation of complete clarity followed by at least **48-hour** clear-and-stable behavior could remove the homogeneity HOLD. It would not establish an exact µL conversion. Exact volume dosing would still require the homogeneous stock's measured **density**; mass dosing and carrier-matched controls are preferred if a later task separately authorizes physical work.

## Claim and action ceiling

Sensory character, target similarity, liking, performance, safety, stability, and release are **NOT TESTED / HOLD**. No procurement, stock preparation, or physical compounding is authorized by this authority sync.
